<title>USA: N.Y. Gov. names Kessel LIPA chairman - paper.</title>
<headline>N.Y. Gov. names Kessel LIPA chairman - paper.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York Gov. George Pataki has named Richard Kessel chairman of Long Island Power Authority (LIPA), Newsday reported Friday.</p>
<p>Kessel is a LIPA trustee.</p>
<p>Pataki said April 9 that Frank Zarb would step down as LIPA head on Friday to become chairman and chief executive officer of the National Association of Securities Dealers.</p>
